# Authorship

**Author:** Codex

When an agent writes or materially edits a research note, experiment note, log
entry, hypothesis section, or plan, add `Author: <agent name>` to that contribution.

Preserve human authorship on predictions and result classifications. Do not label
human-written text as agent-written.
